"From the moment we check our morning news feed to the evening movie we select on a streaming service, invisible recommendation algorithms quietly curate our daily reality. Designed to predict preferences based on past clicks, search histories, and demographic profiles, these mathematical formulas offer undeniable convenience by filtering overwhelming oceans of digital content into tailored suggestions.",
