"Consequently, while the internet provides the technical infrastructure for democratizing knowledge, true universal access remains an unfinished project. Bridging this gap requires public investment in affordable broadband infrastructure, expansion of open-access academic publishing, and digital literacy programs that teach citizens how to locate credible information."
